I personally prefer sym(4) based controllers, but isp(4) ones are
usually fine as well.
Never had success with ahc(4) based on any alpha - although some
persons claim to run them.

> An 18GB Hitachi passed the probing, but the sysinstall never found
> the drive to open for partitioning, even though the probing showed
> it as da0.

Sysinstall is picky about old contents.
Clearing the first few sectors will help.

